====Usage notes====
* {{m|en|near|Near}} was originally the [[comparative]] form of {{m|en|nigh}}; the [[superlative]] form was {{m|en|next}}. {{m|en||Nigh}} is used today mostly in archaic, poetic, or regional contexts.

