===Determiner===
{{en-head|det}}

# {{n-g|Denotes the one immediately following the current or most recent one.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Next''' week would be a good time to meet.}}
#: {{ux|en|I'll know better '''next''' time.}}
# {{lb|en|of days of the week or months of the year}} Closest in the [[future]], or closest but one if the closest is very soon; of days, sometimes thought to specifically refer to the instance closest to seven days (one week) in the future.
#: {{ux|en|The party is '''next''' Tuesday; that is, not tomorrow, but eight days from now.}}
#: {{ux|en|When you say '''next''' Thursday, do you mean Thursday this week or Thursday next week?}}

